# Configuration

## Config Hierarchy

```
Hardcoded defaults -> Dataclass fields -> Environment variables -> CLI arguments
```

Higher priority overrides lower. All dataclass defaults can be overridden by env vars.

## ModelConfig (model/client.py)

| Field | Default | Env Var |
|---|---|---|
| base_url | `http://localhost:8000/v1` | `PHONE_AGENT_BASE_URL` |
| api_key | `EMPTY` | `PHONE_AGENT_API_KEY` |
| model_name | `autoglm-phone-9b` | `PHONE_AGENT_MODEL` |
| max_tokens | 3000 | - |
| temperature | 0.0 | - |
| top_p | 0.85 | - |
| frequency_penalty | 0.2 | - |

## AgentConfig (agent.py)

| Field | Default | Env Var |
|---|---|---|
| max_steps | 100 | `PHONE_AGENT_MAX_STEPS` |
| device_id | None | `PHONE_AGENT_DEVICE_ID` |
| lang | "cn" | `PHONE_AGENT_LANG` |
| system_prompt | Auto (from lang) | - |
| verbose | True | - |

## IOSAgentConfig (REMOVED)

This config class was removed along with iOS support. All agent configuration is now in `AgentConfig`.

## Timing Config (config/timing.py)

Hierarchical dataclass with env var overrides:

```python
TimingConfig
├── ActionTimingConfig
│   ├── keyboard_switch_delay: 0.5s    # PHONE_AGENT_KEYBOARD_SWITCH_DELAY
│   ├── text_clear_delay: 0.3s         # PHONE_AGENT_TEXT_CLEAR_DELAY
│   ├── text_input_delay: 0.5s         # PHONE_AGENT_TEXT_INPUT_DELAY
│   └── keyboard_restore_delay: 0.5s   # PHONE_AGENT_KEYBOARD_RESTORE_DELAY
├── DeviceTimingConfig
│   ├── tap_delay: 0.5s                # PHONE_AGENT_TAP_DELAY
│   ├── double_tap_delay: 0.3s         # PHONE_AGENT_DOUBLE_TAP_DELAY
│   ├── double_tap_interval: 0.1s      # PHONE_AGENT_DOUBLE_TAP_INTERVAL
│   ├── long_press_delay: 1.0s         # PHONE_AGENT_LONG_PRESS_DELAY
│   ├── swipe_delay: 1.0s              # PHONE_AGENT_SWIPE_DELAY
│   ├── back_delay: 0.5s               # PHONE_AGENT_BACK_DELAY
│   ├── home_delay: 0.5s               # PHONE_AGENT_HOME_DELAY
│   └── launch_delay: 2.0s             # PHONE_AGENT_LAUNCH_DELAY
└── ConnectionTimingConfig
    ├── adb_restart_delay: 2.0s         # PHONE_AGENT_ADB_RESTART_DELAY
    └── server_restart_delay: 5.0s      # PHONE_AGENT_SERVER_RESTART_DELAY
```

## App Mappings

### Android (config/apps.py)
- `APP_PACKAGES`: 188+ entries, `"微信" -> "com.tencent.mm"`
- `list_supported_apps()`: Returns all app names

**To add a new app**: Add entry to the `APP_PACKAGES` dict.

## i18n (config/i18n.py)

```python
MESSAGES_ZH = {"thinking": "思考中", "action": "执行动作", ...}
MESSAGES_EN = {"thinking": "Thinking", "action": "Action", ...}

get_messages(lang) -> dict  # Returns full message dict
get_message(key, lang) -> str  # Returns single message
```

Used for console output only (not for model prompts).

## CLI Options (main.py)

All env vars have corresponding CLI flags. See `python main.py --help` for full list.

Key flags:
- `--base-url`, `--model`, `--apikey`: Model configuration
- `--device-id`, `--connect`, `--list-devices`: Device management
- `--max-steps`, `--lang`, `--quiet`: Agent behavior
- `--list-apps`: Show supported apps
